            <ArticleTitle>[N-3 polyunsaturated fatty acid in cardiovascular disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>685-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The role of polyunsaturated n-3 fatty acids in prevention of many diseases, especially cardiovascular diseases, is becoming more and more important. In the article most important, selected by the author, studies on their legitimacy of application in prevention of coronary heart disease, sudden death and general cardio-protection are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
